<title>USA: J.P. Morgan names DuPont CEO as director.</title>
<headline>J.P. Morgan names DuPont CEO as director.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan &amp; Co Inc said Wednesday it named John Krol, chief executive and president of DuPont Co, as a director of both J.P. Morgan and its principal banking subsidiary, Morgan Guaranty Trust Co of New York.</p>
<p>His appointment becomes effective January 1, the bank said.</p>
